# The apply journal hashes raw bytes per line (events.jsonl) and chains them
# into snapshot.json. Any EOL rewrite (e.g. core.autocrlf=true turning LF into
# CRLF on checkout) breaks hash verification with "hash chain broken".
# Disable all text handling for journal artifacts: git must treat them as
# opaque binary and never convert, normalize, or diff their line endings.
openspec/**/journal/** -text
